**RESTful API Implementation**
* [ ] Implement OAuth2 token route (`POST /oauth/token`).
* [x] Implement User routes (`GET /users`, `GET /users/:id`, `PATCH /users/:id`).
* [x] Implement Movie routes (`GET /movies`, `GET /movies/:id`).
* [ ] Implement Comment routes (`GET /comments`, `GET /comments/:id`, `POST /comments`).
* [ ] Configure explicit HTTP status error handling for invalid endpoints.


